WEBVTT

00:24:56.454 --> 00:25:00.496
and it it leaves me wondering a little
bit if if actually wondering a lot.

00:25:00.871 --> 00:25:03.871
I'm just going to wonder, no matter
how much I'm wondering about it,

00:25:04.496 --> 00:25:09.329
I I love measuring culture change by
looking at the vocabulary people use.

00:25:09.829 --> 00:25:12.288
I guess I guess maybe this is a little
bit of a chicken in the egg.

00:25:12.288 --> 00:25:16.371
But is it possible that the vocabulary
you're introducing is is creating

00:25:16.371 --> 00:25:18.079
the change, not just reflecting it?

00:25:18.413 --> 00:25:23.121
Yeah, I think language is praksis. It is.
It is the theory of change.

00:25:23.121 --> 00:25:26.121
It is the practice of change all
wrapped up into one thing.

00:25:26.371 --> 00:25:29.538
And you know, the greatest
compliment that I get,